  "descriptionHtml": "<div>Stainless steel case with a two-tone (silver and gold PVD) stainless steel bracelet. Fixed gold PVD bezel. White dial with gold-tone hands and index hour markers. Minute markers around the outer rim. Dial Type: Analog. Date display at the 3 o'clock position. Chronograph - three sub-dials displaying: 60 second, 30 minute and 6 hour. Automatic movement with a 45 hour power reserve. Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. Skeleton case back. Case diameter: 42 mm. Case thickness: 13 mm. Round case shape. Bracelet width: 19 mm. Fold over clasp. Water resistant at 30 meters / 100 feet. Functions: chronograph, date, hour, minute, second. Casual watch style. Tissot Carson Automatic Chronograph White Dial Two-tone Men's Watch T0854272201100.</div>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Brand</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Tissot</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Series</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Carson</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Model</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">T085.427.22.011.00</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Gender</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Men's</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Movement</td><td style=